WEBVTT

00:00:01.370 --> 00:00:05.230
I believe your hypothesis is correct. 
That the four identical girls,

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:09.560
in the four dimensions, are connected 
to the Aquaria Project.

00:00:10.330 --> 00:00:11.920
Revival Zero...

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:16.800
Surely, this is at the heart 
of Leo Akaba's plan.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:19.310
And given the existence of Joeri...

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:22.300
Yuya, you must be connected, too.

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:25.910
I'm involved in Academia's plan?

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:28.510
Can it be... Are we...

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:32.110
But if bringing all four girls together

00:00:32.110 --> 00:00:35.880
will complete Leo Akaba's plan,

00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:38.300
nothing that might happen 
would surprise me.

00:00:39.130 --> 00:00:41.200
No matter what becomes of you Lancers,

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:45.420
I want you to trust in the power of 
your allies. And fight to the end.

00:00:50.870 --> 00:00:53.770
In a world split into four dimensions,

00:00:53.770 --> 00:00:57.540
four boys exist, all with the same face.

00:00:58.360 --> 00:01:01.340
Their dragons call to each other,

00:01:01.790 --> 00:01:04.600
almost as if seeking one another.

00:02:38.240 --> 00:02:43.010
Survival Duel

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:45.880
Sanders here.

00:02:45.880 --> 00:02:49.710
The enemy's main force has landed 
on the island's north side!

00:02:50.130 --> 00:02:51.280
Understood.

00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:53.950
Proceed immediately, according to the plan.

00:02:53.950 --> 00:02:57.420
But stop Yusyo Sakaki at any cost.

00:02:57.740 --> 00:02:59.340
Understood!

00:02:59.340 --> 00:03:00.420
Leave it to me.

00:03:10.310 --> 00:03:13.610
Damn, he's really making 
us climb this thing...

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:16.610
Stop complaining,

00:03:16.910 --> 00:03:18.760
and get up there!

00:03:20.930 --> 00:03:23.520
Okay, great... I see we're all here.

00:03:23.520 --> 00:03:24.540
Good work.

00:03:24.540 --> 00:03:25.790
Too slow, Sawatari!

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:28.500
You're holding everyone up!

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:34.160
Well, shall we?

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:36.230
Everyone, follow me.

00:03:39.860 --> 00:03:41.790
Salute your instructor!

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:45.000
Ladies and gentlemen.

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:51.210
Today, I will hold a special lesson 
for you, the elite class

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:53.680
that earned the best grades 
at Duel Academia.

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:59.000
Your target is a group called the Lancers, 
which opposes our Academia.

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:02.960
Currently, they are attempting an 
audacious invasion of the island,

00:04:02.960 --> 00:04:06.160
and are approaching our 
sacred halls of learning.

00:04:06.460 --> 00:04:10.830
You are to use them as stepping stones

00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:13.530
to become first-rate duel warriors!

00:04:13.530 --> 00:04:14.650
Yes, sir!

00:04:18.890 --> 00:04:22.860
I thought once we made landfall, 
they'd throw a welcome party,

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:24.580
but it's awfully quiet.

00:04:25.010 --> 00:04:27.840
Perhaps, when they learned 
that the great Shingo Sawatari,

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:32.810
who'd caused them so much trouble in City 
and Heartland was here, they ran in fear.

00:04:32.810 --> 00:04:34.380
No, they're here.

00:04:34.900 --> 00:04:36.730
Indeed. We are...

00:04:36.730 --> 00:04:38.090
...surrounded.

00:04:45.830 --> 00:04:47.430
That's more like it.

00:04:47.430 --> 00:04:49.600
Then, just as we planned...

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:51.070
Let's get started!

00:04:51.070 --> 00:04:52.160
Yeah!

00:04:56.940 --> 00:04:58.840
If we get surrounded by Academia soldiers...

00:04:59.570 --> 00:05:01.310
To start off, Yuya, I...

00:05:01.310 --> 00:05:03.680
...and myself will charge in, 
to draw their attention.

00:05:05.920 --> 00:05:07.280
All right, now!

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:08.260
This way.

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:13.430
And while they do, I'll break through 
the circle with Layra and Reiji.

00:05:13.430 --> 00:05:14.660
They're getting away.

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:15.510
After them!

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:18.700
And when they pursue, the man Gongenzaka...

00:05:18.700 --> 00:05:21.720
...and the hyper-strong 
duelist Shingo Sawatari

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:23.500
will block the pursuers!

00:05:26.320 --> 00:05:29.740
Leave them to us! Get going!

00:05:29.740 --> 00:05:32.760
You can't let the enemy boss get away!

00:05:32.760 --> 00:05:35.580
Got it! Thanks a lot!

00:05:36.040 --> 00:05:38.220
Once Reiji and the others are safely gone...

00:05:38.220 --> 00:05:38.990
All right!

00:05:38.990 --> 00:05:39.780
Yeah.

00:05:39.780 --> 00:05:41.520
Now, we just have to...

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:43.250
...beat these guys!

00:05:43.640 --> 00:05:44.760
Duel!

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:50.230
Instructor, an enemy group broke through 
our formation and is heading this way.

00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:53.060
Has our plan to capture them failed?

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:56.670
There is no issue here.

00:05:56.670 --> 00:05:59.640
All has gone according to our scenario.

00:05:59.930 --> 00:06:04.090
There are five enemies, and we have 
three times the military prowess.

00:06:04.090 --> 00:06:07.110
If you were the commander, 
what would your strategy be?

00:06:07.620 --> 00:06:10.990
Defeat them with continuous 
attacks, three on one!

00:06:10.990 --> 00:06:13.260
Enter battle royal mode immediately.

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:15.920
We're Academia duelists. 
One on one is more than enough.

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:21.190
I already told you! The mission is 
capture, not elimination!

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:23.920
Yes, sir! Forgive us!

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:26.010
It's fine...

00:06:26.010 --> 00:06:31.360
You watch and see how we 
manage to capture them!

00:06:31.360 --> 00:06:32.000
Yes, sir.

00:06:33.970 --> 00:06:35.070
Battle.

00:06:35.070 --> 00:06:40.450
I attack Ancient Gear Hunting 
Hound with Big Benkei!

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:55.790
I attack Double Ancient Gear Hunting 
Hound with Raikiri the Rain Shower!

00:07:01.030 --> 00:07:03.710
Go, Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:07:03.710 --> 00:07:06.000
Spiral Strike Burst!

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:10.920
Damn...

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:13.720
They're running away?

00:07:13.720 --> 00:07:15.840
Won't Superstar and I get to shine?

00:07:15.840 --> 00:07:16.600
Don't let them escape.

00:07:16.600 --> 00:07:18.320
Let me fight, too!

00:07:18.320 --> 00:07:22.690
Our mission is to allow Lord Reiji Akaba 
to reach the inner sanctum.

00:07:22.690 --> 00:07:24.020
Let none impede them.

00:07:26.220 --> 00:07:27.230
No.

00:07:27.230 --> 00:07:28.120
Wait!

00:07:28.120 --> 00:07:29.580
Just ahead, there's an enemy—

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:30.910
Trap activated!

00:07:30.910 --> 00:07:31.800
Roundup!

00:07:34.240 --> 00:07:35.420
They got us.

00:07:36.230 --> 00:07:37.740
Damn...

00:07:37.740 --> 00:07:39.200
They planned everything.

00:07:40.690 --> 00:07:42.780
When the enemy withdrew, 
without cause,

00:07:42.780 --> 00:07:46.000
I should have known a trap lay ahead...

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:47.580
I have failed!

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:50.220
Mission complete.

00:07:50.220 --> 00:07:52.440
All five successfully captured.

00:07:52.880 --> 00:07:57.090
Excellent work... 
As expected of my students.

00:08:01.800 --> 00:08:04.230
The special lesson will now begin!

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:10.400
Ted! Ethan! Barney! Jacob! 
Emma! Step forward!

00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:11.480
Yes, sir!

00:08:13.090 --> 00:08:14.600
Of the elite class I teach,

00:08:14.600 --> 00:08:20.010
you five have proven to have the 
highest potential in live duels.

00:08:20.610 --> 00:08:24.990
I will unleash you and the five 
captives in the arena.

00:08:24.990 --> 00:08:29.370
We will then hold a survival duel, 
with your lives on the line.

00:08:29.840 --> 00:08:33.220
This is not practice! It is a real battle!

00:08:33.550 --> 00:08:35.820
You are duelists of the modern era.

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:38.110
Let your battle souls burn! Survive!

00:08:38.110 --> 00:08:41.230
Devour the strong, and make 
them your flesh and blood!

00:08:41.230 --> 00:08:43.940
Win and stand taller than anyone!

00:08:43.940 --> 00:08:46.550
Glory on the Academia!

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:49.110
Glory on the Academia!

00:08:49.990 --> 00:08:52.580
At last, it will be born.

00:08:52.950 --> 00:08:56.890
My masterpiece...

00:08:59.110 --> 00:09:00.340
What is this place?

00:09:03.220 --> 00:09:06.450
This is the sacred birthplace of duel warriors

00:09:06.450 --> 00:09:09.460
here, at our Duel Academia.

00:09:09.790 --> 00:09:11.160
Duel warriors?

00:09:11.670 --> 00:09:14.190
Stop using duels as tools of war!

00:09:14.190 --> 00:09:15.930
It's wrong!

00:09:17.400 --> 00:09:21.760
I am going to treat you as 
the ultimate entertainment.

00:09:21.760 --> 00:09:23.400
The ultimate entertainment?

00:09:23.400 --> 00:09:24.840
Enough of your boasts!

00:09:24.840 --> 00:09:27.010
Why did you bring us here?

00:09:27.010 --> 00:09:32.020
You are materials, to be used in a special 
class for our Academia students.

00:09:34.820 --> 00:09:40.400
I will now hold a battle royal between 
you five and my five elites.

00:09:40.400 --> 00:09:44.330
Until only one remains in the arena...

00:09:44.660 --> 00:09:46.570
Only one remains?

00:09:46.570 --> 00:09:48.650
You mean they'll fight each other, too?

00:09:48.650 --> 00:09:49.660
Yes.

00:09:49.660 --> 00:09:53.000
It is a survival duel, with lives at stake.

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:55.440
So, the losers will be turned into cards?

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:57.100
Of course.

00:09:57.100 --> 00:10:01.380
This is a special class to create 
the ultimate warrior, after all.

00:10:01.690 --> 00:10:02.860
Don't be ridiculous!

00:10:02.860 --> 00:10:04.850
I won't fight a duel like that!

00:10:04.850 --> 00:10:06.720
You are free not to participate.

00:10:06.720 --> 00:10:11.320
But then you'll be turned into a card, 
without even a fighting chance.

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:15.630
My elites!

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:22.500
What Academia needs is not mere 
honor students, but warriors!

00:10:22.500 --> 00:10:25.260
Become the strongest!

00:10:25.260 --> 00:10:27.360
I pray for your success!

00:10:27.360 --> 00:10:29.710
Glory on the Academia!

00:10:30.040 --> 00:10:32.440
Glory on the Academia!

00:10:33.170 --> 00:10:34.220
Let's go!

00:10:34.220 --> 00:10:39.210
I activate my Field Spell Predaprimal Jungle!

00:10:43.590 --> 00:10:46.060
Field Spell Crossover.

00:10:49.530 --> 00:10:53.740
Go! Let the survival duel begin!

00:11:01.030 --> 00:11:04.740
A survival duel, where only one 
person comes out alive...

00:11:05.070 --> 00:11:08.110
In other words, even if we 
can't turn them into cards,

00:11:08.110 --> 00:11:11.950
if they lose, Academia will...

00:11:11.950 --> 00:11:13.960
I don't accept that!

00:11:13.960 --> 00:11:15.160
I won't do it!

00:11:15.160 --> 00:11:18.820
Then, you'll just let them 
turn you into a card?

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:22.890
I'll be the last one standing.

00:11:22.890 --> 00:11:24.410
No, I will.

00:11:24.410 --> 00:11:26.780
I'll also defeat more Lancers 
than any of you.

00:11:28.960 --> 00:11:31.110
You won't beat me!

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:35.030
What Sawatari says makes sense.

00:11:35.720 --> 00:11:38.410
If we don't survive, we can't get out of here,

00:11:38.410 --> 00:11:42.060
let alone save Yuya's father and Yuzu.

00:11:42.060 --> 00:11:43.280
Tsukikage!

00:11:43.280 --> 00:11:46.720
Our first priority is to get a feel 
for how the enemy moves.

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:48.280
The rest of you, remain here.

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:49.620
Tsukikage!

00:11:54.400 --> 00:11:58.430
It was my failure that put my allies 
in this desperate situation.

00:11:58.430 --> 00:12:04.520
I must stop the enemy, and create a 
chance for my allies to escape!

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:12.520
On the move, eh?

00:12:12.980 --> 00:12:15.840
Time for the special lesson to start.

00:12:15.840 --> 00:12:20.680
You will all get to witness the 
birth of the ultimate warrior.

00:12:20.990 --> 00:12:23.690
Commit this entire duel to memory!

00:12:24.030 --> 00:12:25.030
Yes, sir!

00:12:29.650 --> 00:12:30.860
I feel them.

00:12:30.860 --> 00:12:33.980
The eyes of a predator, watching its prey...

00:12:33.980 --> 00:12:35.070
Watching me!

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:42.980
The Lancers are here?

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:52.350
What?

00:12:52.350 --> 00:12:53.440
Who was beaten?

00:12:53.440 --> 00:12:55.160
You don't think... Was it Tsukikage?

00:12:55.160 --> 00:12:56.040
Let's go!

00:12:57.080 --> 00:12:59.620
Someone already got one of the Lancers?

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:02.420
Not bad. I'd better get started!

00:13:03.240 --> 00:13:04.420
That was...

00:13:04.960 --> 00:13:07.200
Tsukikage!

00:13:07.200 --> 00:13:08.810
I'm sure it was around here.

00:13:08.810 --> 00:13:10.010
Look, Yuya!

00:13:13.380 --> 00:13:15.010
Wh-What is this?

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:17.160
An Academia student?

00:13:17.160 --> 00:13:19.140
You think Tsukikage did this?

00:13:19.140 --> 00:13:20.680
What are you saying?

00:13:20.680 --> 00:13:21.930
He would never...

00:13:21.930 --> 00:13:26.120
Perhaps Academia turned a duelist 
that Tsukikage beat into a card.

00:13:27.000 --> 00:13:27.940
Who's there?

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:30.090
Did you do this?

00:13:30.090 --> 00:13:32.670
Wait! Don't run!

00:13:32.670 --> 00:13:34.060
Hey, Sawatari!

00:13:34.390 --> 00:13:36.110
Don't run off on your own!

00:13:39.520 --> 00:13:42.120
One beaten already...

00:13:42.120 --> 00:13:44.370
He's still so indiscriminate.

00:13:45.160 --> 00:13:48.840
Hey, I saw the word "Lost" 
appear for a second. What?

00:13:49.210 --> 00:13:52.880
I don't see any sign of battle. 
Is it some kind of bug?

00:13:52.880 --> 00:13:57.180
Yeah, it's still showing ten players.

00:13:57.180 --> 00:13:59.710
But there are only four

00:13:59.710 --> 00:14:02.160
of my hand-picked elite forces.

00:14:02.160 --> 00:14:03.390
I'm certain!

00:14:09.140 --> 00:14:10.160
Ethan!

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:11.500
Wait, Ted!

00:14:11.500 --> 00:14:14.200
Didn't we agree we'd only 
fight at the very end?

00:14:14.740 --> 00:14:18.310
That's right. We'll hunt the Lancers first.

00:14:18.980 --> 00:14:21.480
Okay, I think I lost them...

00:14:21.480 --> 00:14:22.540
Lost them?

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:25.680
Did you run from the Lancers, 
without fighting?!

00:14:26.020 --> 00:14:28.170
I... I couldn't help it!

00:14:28.170 --> 00:14:31.980
There were four of them 
and something else...

00:14:35.570 --> 00:14:37.380
Damn, where'd he go?

00:14:38.450 --> 00:14:40.660
Huh? Where are Yuya and the others?

00:14:42.450 --> 00:14:43.710
He lost us.

00:14:43.710 --> 00:14:45.590
Damn... Sawatari!

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:49.230
Sawatari! Crow!

00:14:49.230 --> 00:14:51.300
Where are you?

00:14:51.300 --> 00:14:53.200
I told them not to run off.

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:57.140
I see. Barney's gone.

00:14:58.040 --> 00:15:00.840
But he lost because he was weak.

00:15:00.840 --> 00:15:03.580
Whether there had been
 four enemies or five,

00:15:03.580 --> 00:15:06.150
I'd have turned them all 
into cards on the spot!

00:15:06.440 --> 00:15:08.340
Barney, a card...

00:15:08.960 --> 00:15:11.070
H-Hey, Ted...

00:15:11.070 --> 00:15:14.010
If we lose, will we be turned into cards, too?

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:16.410
Not that I think we'll lose.

00:15:16.410 --> 00:15:18.970
But when I saw Barney turned into a card,

00:15:18.970 --> 00:15:21.530
I thought, "What if I end up the same way?"

00:15:21.530 --> 00:15:25.010
Has entering the battlefield 
infected you with cowardice?

00:15:25.010 --> 00:15:27.370
I'll take on all the Lancers myself!

00:15:27.370 --> 00:15:30.010
A loser like you can stay and shiver here!

00:15:30.010 --> 00:15:31.850
A loser?

00:15:31.850 --> 00:15:33.210
Hey, wait!

00:15:34.150 --> 00:15:37.670
Where'd those Academia students go?

00:15:38.050 --> 00:15:41.080
Hey! Stop hiding and come out!

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:46.020
I'll crush you all myself, even if 
you come out in a group!

00:15:48.350 --> 00:15:49.660
Take that and that!

00:15:52.080 --> 00:15:53.440
Wh-Wh-What?

00:15:53.440 --> 00:15:54.730
What was that, just now?

00:15:55.240 --> 00:16:01.230
But to use a survival duel, with only 
one left standing, as a class...

00:16:01.230 --> 00:16:05.110
Academia's worse than the 
Public Security Bureau.

00:16:07.220 --> 00:16:10.010
An ambush, now? How low can you sink?!

00:16:14.610 --> 00:16:15.750
Tsukikage?

00:16:16.420 --> 00:16:18.720
I found the Lancers!

00:16:19.520 --> 00:16:21.830
They seem to be fighting someone.

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:23.790
Who is it?

00:16:32.020 --> 00:16:35.910
Then, I attack with Twilight 
Ninja Nichirin, the Chunin!

00:16:35.910 --> 00:16:38.400
Go! Battle, Nichirin!

00:16:45.840 --> 00:16:46.870
Did I finish it?

00:16:56.440 --> 00:16:59.530
I set one card and end my turn.

00:17:02.310 --> 00:17:04.080
Give me a little fun, too!

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:08.170
2000-point penalty for entering the battle.

00:17:08.680 --> 00:17:10.140
Another one?

00:17:16.890 --> 00:17:18.900
Wh-Why?

00:17:20.650 --> 00:17:23.420
What? Were they not on the same side?

00:17:28.590 --> 00:17:31.330
Who are you?

00:17:36.810 --> 00:17:39.740
The minute Ted entered the battle, 
there was a "Lost" reaction.

00:17:39.740 --> 00:17:44.240
Why? No one had started. 
What was there to enter?

00:17:45.080 --> 00:17:46.750
Is it possible...

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:50.570
The last reaction really was 
someone getting beaten?

00:17:51.120 --> 00:17:52.620
No way!

00:17:52.620 --> 00:17:55.660
You're saying the signal 
earlier wasn't a bug?

00:17:55.660 --> 00:17:58.320
Then, there are too many people.

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:13.540
Is this the end?

00:18:13.540 --> 00:18:14.410
In that case...

00:18:16.000 --> 00:18:17.130
That voice...

00:18:17.130 --> 00:18:18.380
Tsukikage!

00:18:19.560 --> 00:18:20.610
That way!

00:18:23.170 --> 00:18:24.570
That light...

00:18:24.570 --> 00:18:25.820
Could it be?

00:18:25.820 --> 00:18:26.920
Let's hurry!

00:18:33.110 --> 00:18:34.540
Tsukikage...

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:37.270
How could Tsukikage fall?

00:18:39.090 --> 00:18:42.600
For one with Tsukikage's 
skill to fall... Impossible!

00:18:43.040 --> 00:18:44.490
Tsukikage...

00:18:44.490 --> 00:18:46.550
For him to be beaten this badly...

00:18:47.920 --> 00:18:51.200
And the other is another Academia student.

00:18:51.200 --> 00:18:55.180
Will the students really just 
turn anyone into cards?

00:18:56.290 --> 00:18:59.260
No, there might be someone else.

00:18:59.260 --> 00:19:00.360
Someone else?

00:19:01.450 --> 00:19:08.690
11

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:05.980
I think Tsukikage wrote this.

00:19:06.500 --> 00:19:08.690
Does it mean "eleven"?

00:19:08.690 --> 00:19:12.250
Yeah, five of us and the Academia five.

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:14.920
Ten of us, sent onto this field.

00:19:14.920 --> 00:19:19.170
I doubt the students would fight 
each other while we're still here.

00:19:19.550 --> 00:19:20.780
I see.

00:19:20.780 --> 00:19:25.030
If there were eleven, that would 
explain what's going on.

00:19:25.030 --> 00:19:28.350
In this forest, we and the 
students aren't alone.

00:19:28.350 --> 00:19:30.170
Something else is hiding here.

00:19:30.680 --> 00:19:33.690
That's what Tsukikage used 
his last moments to tell us.

00:19:33.690 --> 00:19:35.150
Let's go, Yuya!

00:19:35.150 --> 00:19:39.600
Yeah. It's dangerous for us 
to be split up right now.

00:19:39.600 --> 00:19:42.230
We must find Sawatari and Crow at once!

00:19:42.960 --> 00:19:44.660
S-Stop it...

00:19:45.100 --> 00:19:46.380
S-Stop.

00:19:47.090 --> 00:19:49.200
Stay back! Get away!

00:19:57.000 --> 00:19:59.400
Damn! What's going on?

00:19:59.400 --> 00:20:01.480
Has someone started a duel?

00:20:01.480 --> 00:20:03.510
Where did Yuya and the others go?

00:20:07.860 --> 00:20:09.420
Is someone there?

00:20:12.890 --> 00:20:15.860
What? Who are you?

00:20:16.150 --> 00:20:18.330
I see your eyes shining in the dark.

00:20:18.740 --> 00:20:23.280
If you want to fight the ultra, 
hyper-strong duelist Shingo Sawatari,

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:26.070
stop hiding and show yourself!

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:28.760
That sounds like Sawatari!

00:20:29.190 --> 00:20:30.540
This way?

00:20:33.990 --> 00:20:35.750
Don't go, Rin...

00:20:36.160 --> 00:20:37.670
Stop it...

00:20:37.670 --> 00:20:41.380
Don't join Academia!

00:20:42.970 --> 00:20:45.590
Are you all right? Any injuries?

00:20:46.070 --> 00:20:48.190
Who are you? Are you with Academia?

00:20:48.190 --> 00:20:49.740
Not any longer.

00:20:49.740 --> 00:20:51.520
I am Edo Phoenix,

00:20:51.520 --> 00:20:53.900
an ally to Yuya and Syun Kurosaki.

00:20:54.200 --> 00:20:55.640
Yuya and Syun?

00:20:55.640 --> 00:20:57.000
Are they here, too?

00:20:57.280 --> 00:21:02.120
Yes. Kurosaki went to the western 
tower to save his little sister, Ruri.

00:21:02.120 --> 00:21:03.870
Are you Hugo, then?

00:21:03.870 --> 00:21:07.990
Kaito mentioned you'd gone to the eastern 
tower to save a girl named Rin.

00:21:07.990 --> 00:21:08.830
Rin!

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:11.630
That's right. I saved Rin!

00:21:11.630 --> 00:21:13.300
But she...

00:21:17.300 --> 00:21:19.410
She'd changed...

00:21:19.410 --> 00:21:21.760
She wasn't the Rin I knew at all.

00:21:22.500 --> 00:21:25.860
She's being controlled. So is Ruri.

00:21:27.080 --> 00:21:32.200
After Kaito saved Ruri, she pushed 
him out of the tower.

00:21:32.500 --> 00:21:35.880
Even still, Kurosaki insisted 
he'd save his sister himself.

00:21:39.030 --> 00:21:41.390
To return them to normal,

00:21:41.390 --> 00:21:44.480
we must find and beat the 
one controlling them.

00:21:44.480 --> 00:21:46.940
Most likely, he is close to the Professor.

00:21:46.940 --> 00:21:47.720
It's a bug.

00:21:48.860 --> 00:21:52.580
I saw it! That bug is what's controlling Rin!

00:22:02.340 --> 00:22:06.140
Unless we destroy that bug, 
Rin won't ever return to normal!

00:22:08.160 --> 00:22:09.510
Bug?

00:23:50.040 --> 00:23:54.850
Birds with beautiful wings, assemble on 
the battlefield and shine with glory!

00:23:55.260 --> 00:23:56.580
Xyz Summon!

00:23:56.580 --> 00:24:02.620
Descend, Rank 1 Lyrilusc — 
Assembled Nightingale!

00:24:02.620 --> 00:24:03.490
There's no question.

00:24:03.960 --> 00:24:06.720
This really is Ruri's deck.

00:24:07.120 --> 00:24:09.130
These are Ruri's tactics.

00:24:10.230 --> 00:24:14.000
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
The Songbird Fallen Into Darkness.

00:24:14.440 --> 00:24:16.300
The fun is only getting started!
